step Deadwood Village
  tip The Deadwood furbolg village lies just south of the Sanctuary. Every Deadwood kill also raises your Timbermaw Hold reputation; keep the headdress feathers. Keep killing them until level 53.92: the Sanctuary's next hand-ins and Jaedenar want it. Or, with a group, run the Sunken Temple dungeon or the Blackrock Depths dungeon instead.
