step Irontree Woods
  tip Follow the road north-east to Irontree Woods. The Warpwood Moss Flayers and Shredders on the east side of the woods each carry a Blood Amber; Angerclaw Grizzlies and Felpaw Ravagers roam the same woods for Talo. Below level 54.21, keep hunting the grizzlies and ravagers: the hand-ins at Bloodvenom Post and the Emerald Sanctuary take you to level 55. Or, with a group, run the Blackrock Depths dungeon or the Sunken Temple dungeon instead.
  kill 8957 quest 4120.1
  kill 8961 quest 4120.2
